        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif esne of(er) dryhtnes hæse þoewweorc wyrce an sunnan æfen efter hire setlgange oþ monan æfenes setlgang, LXXX scƚƚ se dryhten gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a servant according to his lord’s order does slave-work after sunset on the eve of Sunday until sunset on the eve of Monday, let the lord pay 80 shillings [?sceattas].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif esne ofer dryhtnes hæse þoewweorc wyrce an sunnan æfen efter hire setlgange oþ monan æfenes setlgang, LXXX scll' se dryhtne gebete.</ab>
